        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion T3, Weston Interconnect Interior Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTraditional in style, Fusion Hardware's Weston handleset features oval mounts and a classically shaped grab. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, brushed nickel, and lifetime polished brass. It features an Interconnect interior option which opens the door from the inside without having to unlock the deadbolt. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches and is available in either 2-3/8 inch and 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Interconnected Single Cylinder Handleset</b> allows you to simply turn your interior lever or knob to open your door without having to unlock the deadbolt. This handleset is also available as a Dummy which means that it is a non-functional handleset made as a rigid pull for doors that don't need to be locked or latched.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weston Solid Brass Handleset Fusion T3:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion T3 New Traditional Door Entry Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside. The Interconnect Interior option opens the door from the inside without having to unlock the deadbolt first.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Weston New Traditional Handleset With Interconnect, Fusion T3",
                "description": "Weston New Traditional Handleset With Interconnect Fusion T3 - Traditional in style, Fusion Hardware's Weston handleset features oval mounts and a classically shaped grab. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, brushed nickel, and lifetime polished brass. It features an Interconnect interior option which opens the door from the inside without having to unlock the deadbolt. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches and is available in either 2-3/8 inch and 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "FUS-T3, fusion hardware T3 handlesets, solid brass handlesets, traditional handlesets, fusion hardware new traditional collections, fusion hardware Weston handlesets, fusion Weston new traditional handlesets, oval handlesets, fusion hardware H T3, interconnect handlesets, panic proof handlesets, panic-proof Weston door entry handles,"
